        'A report that compares cancelling your contract with the developer against selling it through Lokta, using your figures and the market values we use. The figures are estimates; the report is prepared when you list your unit.',
        'FAQ 9'],
    ['faq.q10', 'faq', 'لو ألغيت العقد مع المطوّر، هخسر قد إيه؟', 'If I cancel my contract with the developer, how much do I lose?', 'FAQ 10 (legal notes, K2)', 'legal'],
    ['faq.a10', 'faq',
        'غالبًا المطوّر بيخصم نسبة من الثمن، وفي حاسبة الخروج هتلاقي النسبة اللي بنستخدمها. لكن لو العقد اتفسخ بسبب تقصير من المطوّر، من حقك تسترد كل اللي دفعته من غير خصم. ولو كنت دافع أكتر من 75% من الثمن، العقد مش بيتفسخ تلقائيًا. راجع عقدك قبل ما تاخد قرارك.',
        'The developer usually deducts a share of the price; the exit calculator shows the share we use. But if the contract is cancelled because the developer was at fault, you are entitled to everything you paid back, with no deduction. And if you have paid more than 75% of the price, the contract is not cancelled automatically. Read your contract before you decide.',
