            'Lokta is an online marketplace that brings together owners of installment property contracts and buyers who want to continue those contracts. Lokta reviews the units\' data and documents, coordinates between the two sides, and follows the transfer procedure at the developer. The transfer itself takes place between the seller and the buyer at the developer, under the unit\'s contract and the developer\'s terms.',
            '## Your account',
